                "text": "Terminal history: Gives details of individual rakes handled at the terminal for a selected period .<div class=\"gr-para\">It is updated by arrival / departure reporting, l/W no. taking. Rake placement/rel tasks. Terminal performance and running position: gives status of load at terminal along with its insight. It is updated by arrival /departure reporting, I/W no. asking, rake placement/release tasks.</div>"
